Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 17:24:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] =?UTF-8?q?fix(guide):=20no=20fundir=20a=20negro=20al?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20abrir=20GUIDE=20desde=20el=20men=C3=BA=20Start?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

HandleStartMenuInput funde a negro con toda entrada que no esté en su lista
de excepciones; la guía se muestra sobre el mapa (como SafariZoneRetire), así
que la pantalla se quedaba en negro y el selector de idioma no se veía.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/start_menu.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/start_menu.c b/src/start_menu.c
index 06b1dec8c..dfc3a2b17 100644
--- a/src/start_menu.c
+++ b/src/start_menu.c
@@ -629,7 +629,8 @@ static bool8 HandleStartMenuInput(void)
         if (gMenuCallback != StartMenuSaveCallback
             && gMenuCallback != StartMenuExitCallback
             && gMenuCallback != StartMenuSafariZoneRetireCallback
-            && gMenuCallback != StartMenuBattlePyramidRetireCallback)
+            && gMenuCallback != StartMenuBattlePyramidRetireCallback
+            && gMenuCallback != StartMenuGuideCallback) // la guía se muestra sobre el mapa: sin fundido a negro
         {
            FadeScreen(FADE_TO_BLACK, 0);
         }
